WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:39.247 --> 00:00:40.915
Damn, that hurts!

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:45.628
I dunno what you've heard,
but I don’t ambush so easy.

00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:56.848
Shit, that was my
ball-scratchin’ hand.

00:00:56.931 --> 00:00:59.893
I oughta kill you now for that image.

00:00:59.976 --> 00:01:01.811
- Don't!
- Please wait!

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:05.148
Don’t shoot.
Them boys meant no harm!

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.942
No? Then how about you?

00:01:08.026 --> 00:01:12.113
Come on, would you hurt
a defenseless old woman?

00:01:12.614 --> 00:01:14.324
Please let it go.

00:01:14.449 --> 00:01:18.870
I'm Mama Hitch. These are
my boys, Joe-Bob and Bob-Bob.

00:01:19.162 --> 00:01:24.501
They’re sweet kids. Ain't no way
they'd commit theft or murder.

00:01:24.626 --> 00:01:26.544
I dunno...

00:01:31.841 --> 00:01:34.719
Pleased to meet you, Mother Hitch!

00:01:34.803 --> 00:01:38.932
I’m Sam,
Special Associate Model from Botica.

00:01:39.307 --> 00:01:42.143
These are my friends
Philly and Casey!

00:01:42.227 --> 00:01:44.229
Seriously? This again?

00:01:44.312 --> 00:01:49.317
She's programmed to be friendly.
Why not watch and learn?

00:01:49.859 --> 00:01:55.365
Pleased to meet you, Sam. Me and my
kin have been stranded here a spell.

00:01:55.490 --> 00:02:00.203
The boys thought you were
marauders coming for a raid.

00:02:00.328 --> 00:02:04.332
Can’t be too careful
‘round these parts.

00:02:05.333 --> 00:02:06.668
You guys are fishy.

